      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "56. 角的度量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把一直角分成90等",
        "份，就得到90个合同的角（图",
        "215）。每一个小角等于直角的",
        "$\\frac{1}{90}$。一个直角的九十分之一叫",
        "做一度，并把它作为度量角的",
        "单位。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 215",
      "box": [
        819,
        924,
        504,
        495
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-215"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个直角的$\\frac{1}{90}$叫做一度。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 215",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果角$MOP$包含40度，那么就说角$MOP$的大小等于",
        "40度，写作：$\\widehat{MOP}=40^{\\circ}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "“$^{\\circ}$”是角的度量单位一度的符号。应当分清楚$\\angle MOP$",
        "和$\\widehat{MOP}$这两种写法。第一种写法读作“角$MOP$”，而第二种",
        "写法读作“角$MOP$的大小”。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "直角的大小等于$90^{\\circ}$，而平角的大小等于$180^{\\circ}$。任何锐"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
